[{"title":"望湖亭","author":"薛蕙","text":"阴磴穿云上，天窗绮雾中。\n苍茫玉泉水，指点翠微东。\n坐石牵萝蔓，攀崖憩桂丛。\n何当避炎暑，几杖待秋风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20432,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"石经寺","author":"薛蕙","text":"翠巘双林合，丹梯一径悬。\n洞门临地底，石室与天连。\n文字开龙藏，金银布梵筵。\n兹山实灵异，吾欲托栖禅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20433,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送蒋国信之桐乡","author":"薛蕙","text":"始对贤良策，登科游汉京。\n俄分尚方履，出宰卧江城。\n余忆东南美，长怀山水情。\n须君为地主，早晚越中行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20434,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"七夕集廷献宅","author":"薛蕙","text":"秉烛开秋宴，更衣坐晚凉。\n云霄降帝子，词赋接仙郎。\n月写蛾眉色，风传玉佩香。\n惭君有妍唱，欲报不成章。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20435,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"七月十五日夜对月","author":"薛蕙","text":"袅袅凉风夕，纷纷零露时。\n秋来看明月，风露已如斯。\n况对西园酌，兼怀康乐诗。\n山中有桂树，今夜足相思。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20436,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"道院秋日海棠","author":"薛蕙","text":"偶来仙馆内，花萼满枝红。\n彷佛看珠树，玲珑映蕊宫。\n预伤白露下，坐惜綵云空。\n踯躅攀条处，佳人不可同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20437,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宴故英国公山亭即文皇帝赐第","author":"薛蕙","text":"东第君王赐，西园宾客来。\n将军元好士，公子复怜才。\n玉袖花间出，金尊竹下开。\n还须明月上，莫畏夕阳催。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20438,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送戴长史","author":"薛蕙","text":"词臣汉廷出，邸第魏王开。\n地即清漳郡，人同邺下才。\n月中游桂苑，风里宴兰台。\n宣室如相访，长沙去复来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20439,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"八月十五日夜同诸友玩月","author":"薛蕙","text":"楼敞含风气，筵开坠露文。\n月从今夕满，秋向此时分。\n影湿当银汉，光斜隔彩云。\n徘徊接新咏，况是鲍参军。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20440,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"书省内壁","author":"薛蕙","text":"终朝谢文墨，嗟此簿书繁。\n日宴高斋静，风来寒鸟喧。\n倦游伤岁序，多病忆田园。\n何事成淫滞，微官岂足言。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20441,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雪","author":"薛蕙","text":"北极关山阔，寒冬雨雪来。\n雾沈玄菟塞，风绕白龙堆。\n胡虏犹深入，征人且未回。\n遥思穆天子，黄竹有悲哀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20442,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"访雍上人","author":"薛蕙","text":"冬日自虚寂，东林地更偏。\n经声行处近，灯影望中然。\n残雪明花苑，寒云荫石筵。\n祇应休浣暇，来此暂安禅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20443,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答士奇","author":"薛蕙","text":"能来驻车辙，不待拆书缄。\n上客同王粲，贫家似阮咸。\n清谈对云竹，缓步倚风杉。\n安得盈杯酒，今朝共尔衔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20444,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同士奇子云饮","author":"薛蕙","text":"春风吹酒杯，花鸟更相催。\n惜此留连坐，判成酩酊回。\n安能自结束，聊复共追陪。\n今日不为乐，流光去若颓。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20445,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"招廷献子云饮","author":"薛蕙","text":"废书多病后，抱杖独行时。\n晚日添花蕊，春风积蔓丝。\n物华空烂漫，心赏每参差。\n迟尔来同醉，能无酒一卮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20446,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"仲夏即事","author":"薛蕙","text":"林卧采芳草，今朝鶗鴂鸣。\n悠悠观物化，默默感吾生。\n老大惭闻道，空虚耻近名。\n沈吟日云暮，搔首独含情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20447,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"落日","author":"薛蕙","text":"落日掩书卧，荒庭起独行。\n回看太虚上，窈霭动秋声。\n寂寞抱真蕴，飘飖遗世情。\n白云不相识，何肯入前楹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20448,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄何仲默","author":"薛蕙","text":"久别忧成结，书来不解颜。\n开缄未读半，揽涕望秦关。\n簿领余方倦，驰驱君讵闲。\n相将保玉体，去去入名山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20449,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九日游兴隆寺","author":"薛蕙","text":"厌就骚人会，欣投释子家。\n林风鸣贝叶，径露湿金沙。\n宴坐依双树，清斋服九华。\n晚来归客倦，欲借白牛车。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20450,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚过仰之置酒","author":"薛蕙","text":"燕京久为客，秋日正思家。\n不忍听鸿雁，相寻醉菊花。\n空庭馀木叶，短褐满风沙。\n同病今如此，酣歌惜岁华。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20451,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚坐有怀","author":"薛蕙","text":"落日照帘栊，寒城烟雾中。\n衔杯对衰菊，流目送归鸿。\n未觉赏心废，但惊亲友空。\n遥遥此时恨，万里托秋风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20452,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"对雪","author":"薛蕙","text":"庭雪晓逾鲜，钩帘兴渺然。\n纷纷堕花絮，袅袅乱风烟。\n怅望游梁赋，沈吟忆戴船。\n佳期每辽阔，留恨阅芳年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20453,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"功德寺","author":"薛蕙","text":"忆昨宣皇帝，西方结胜缘。\n庄严修佛土，功德施人天。\n龙象山开辟，金银地接连。\n伤心万岁后，陵谷尚依然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20454,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"萧氏园 其一","author":"薛蕙","text":"丽日方春暮，名园更水阴。\n葱茏花满径，迤逦竹成林。\n不见川原尽，祗愁云雾深。\n向非沾醉后，幽绝恐难禁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20455,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"萧氏园 其二","author":"薛蕙","text":"径狭褰裳处，川平伏槛前。\n华林一何丽，碧水复相鲜。\n鱼鸟方堪狎，缨緌顿可捐。\n居然谢尘垢，不待濯潺湲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20456,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送马伯循 其一","author":"薛蕙","text":"弱岁来京邑，已闻之子贤。\n长怀慕先达，讵意窃同年。\n感激深相附，逡巡只自怜。\n如何复为别，瞻望益茫然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20457,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送马伯循 其二","author":"薛蕙","text":"城隅饮饯地，日暮朔风吹。\n征鸟不返顾，浮云相背驰。\n踟蹰意何极，叹息涕空垂。\n世路今如此，焉知后会期。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20458,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重游萧氏园 其二","author":"薛蕙","text":"野霭横兰径，泉声落草堂。\n丈夫修雁缴，童子护鱼梁。\n钓弋亦堪老，风尘缘底忙。\n淹留不忍去，日色晚苍苍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20459,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"归别业作","author":"薛蕙","text":"五载去京国，今来归旧庐。\n林荒巢野雀，径毁蔓园蔬。\n意倦风尘际，身危疾病馀。\n多惭久怀禄，牢落此田居。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20460,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"扶策","author":"薛蕙","text":"东风解娱客，往往慰幽栖。\n扶策循兰径，流莺逐我啼。\n青莎已齐叶，红药始含荑。\n昨觅邻家酒，今朝聊可携。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20461,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西园对雨","author":"薛蕙","text":"漠漠春阴黑，连朝卧小园。\n野花川上落，水鹳雨中喧。\n衣裌身犹冷，看书眼欲昏。\n不堪逢寂寞，倚仗有清樽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20462,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"别墅即事","author":"薛蕙","text":"丘中辍耕牧，挈杖返衡门。\n落日茅茨暗，秋天禾黍繁。\n邻人送卮酒，小妇具盘飧。\n念此信为乐，悠然怀故园。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20463,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日溪上","author":"薛蕙","text":"何处窥秋色，搴舟入水隅。\n清波照凫雁，寒露洗菰蒲。\n促迫悲生事，登临快病躯。\n由来野人意，终日羡江湖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20464,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九日颜子携饮西郭","author":"薛蕙","text":"九日愁空卧，西园喜并游。\n閒居同栗里，置酒得荆州。\n树拥楼台出，云随鼓吹浮。\n不辞重落帽，短发自堪羞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20465,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"新馆","author":"薛蕙","text":"别墅栖迟处，高斋登眺初。\n故渠临圃近，新竹绕庭疏。\n素心已澹泊，绝学转空虚。\n非关选幽胜，偶此寄吾庐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20466,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚过邻叟","author":"薛蕙","text":"野外岁阴早，晚色正霏微。\n石兰向风靡，海鹤犯霜飞。\n投策暂云憩，采苓方未归。\n幽人已相候，隔水启荆扉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20467,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"环堵","author":"薛蕙","text":"环堵郊墟外，衡门野道边。\n林昏罢风夜，月白欲霜天。\n落魄随身世，栖迟失岁年。\n平生有微志，今已愧前贤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20468,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"不寐","author":"薛蕙","text":"一榻微寒入，山房夜未扃。\n凝思天籁发，不寐谷神醒。\n本自淹衰疾，何堪役性灵。\n列仙如可学，吾欲驻颓龄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20469,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"丘中","author":"薛蕙","text":"返照丘中路，孤烟水上村。\n野田荒藓色，沙岸落潮痕。\n日短䞉书卷，天寒频酒樽。\n定知无客到，不必扫柴门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20470,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"原上晓望","author":"薛蕙","text":"平原摇落尽，极目见寒空。\n初日烟尘外，沧波昼夜东。\n孤芳遗雨雪，高鸟下天风。\n俛仰无相晤，长歌思不穷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20471,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚步","author":"薛蕙","text":"落日满平芜，风烟似画图。\n空林助鸣鹤，远浦失归凫。\n白帻狂犹岸，青藜倦自扶。\n歘思酬物色，佳句未应无。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20472,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寂寂","author":"薛蕙","text":"寂寂多相笑，悠悠略自谙。\n谋生只如此，经国更何堪。\n偃仰身微健，疏慵味颇甘。\n敢云忘魏阙，正尔恋江潭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20473,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠顾英玉时谪许州过亳见访","author":"薛蕙","text":"残冬江北路，寒苦异金陵。\n驽马行来远，衰颜别后增。\n剑埋馀紫气，玉玷有青蝇。\n世故多堪惜，因君重抚膺。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20474,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"漕河舟中作","author":"薛蕙","text":"悠悠漕河水，今日更遄征。\n敢议占时出，祗言循禄行。\n田园违宿昔，轩冕累平生。\n缅忆高贤迹，迟回何限情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20475,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元夜诸公会不赴","author":"薛蕙","text":"九陌帝城中，烟花绕汉宫。\n银河流夜月，火树煖春风。\n衾枕忧如昨，轩车恨不同。\n时闻玉珂响，寂寞卧墙东。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20476,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送南元善守绍兴","author":"薛蕙","text":"传闻会稽郡，清绝擅三吴。\n水竹深兰渚，云峰满镜湖。\n论交愧连璧，出守羡分符。\n时有东南使，新诗未可无。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20477,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"文徵仲蔡九逵初至都下会饮兴隆寺王直夫馆中分韵得凉字","author":"薛蕙","text":"把烛寻山径，开樽扫石堂。\n风流初邂逅，露坐转清凉。\n竹树寒云色，花林宿雨香。\n高谈真绝倒，无暇问津梁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20478,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送朱侍御之南台","author":"薛蕙","text":"不谓云霄去，能为江海行。\n知君古人意，非是厌承明。\n出国仍簪笔，忧时未请缨。\n他年有封事，更觉见平生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20479,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同大复避暑寺中","author":"薛蕙","text":"携客东林院，凉宵扫竹亭。\n龙珠寒露殿，宝树影云扃。\n听法元清净，观心自杳冥。\n坐中馀爽气，虚对北山青。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20480,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"王明叔东谷卷","author":"薛蕙","text":"谷断悬山阁，崖通度石桥。\n日蒸沧海气，霞动赤城标。\n雪壁花先映，霜严叶后凋。\n空题招隐曲，怅望隔云霄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20481,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"玄明宫后圃石山","author":"薛蕙","text":"出郭仙城近，探幽福地遥。\n珠林行窈窕，锦石上岧峣。\n云里仙人酒，山中玉女箫。\n蓬莱去何许，东望海边潮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20482,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"二月八日趋事山陵出郭有述","author":"薛蕙","text":"出郭云沙静，迎人谷鸟喧。\n春行趁风日，夜望极川原。\n山翠晴偏近，林芳暖欲繁。\n登临吾所好，幽兴忽飞翻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20483,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"行次陵下","author":"薛蕙","text":"涧坼欹金岸，峰回转翠屏。\n园陵何郁郁，气色但冥冥。\n天外云长白，山中草自青。\n徘徊践霜露，愁寂仰岩扃。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20484,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"祀归作","author":"薛蕙","text":"始验灵风集，俄瞻紫气遥。\n玄宫罢歌吹，玉佩散云霄。\n仙驭纷皆逝，天香宛自飘。\n青山怅回首，松柏转萧萧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20485,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚憩玉泉寺","author":"薛蕙","text":"看山兴不辍，落日有馀情。\n稍憩中林宿，犹攀绝顶行。\n风泉晚逾响，松雪夜微明。\n长啸云岑上，飘萧白露生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20486,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泛舟 其一","author":"薛蕙","text":"别馆初停骑，横塘更泛舟。\n兰芳满南浦，翠羽覆春洲。\n落日明渔火，微风引棹讴。\n今朝泥行乐，那减习池游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20487,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泛舟 其二","author":"薛蕙","text":"水口移舟入，烟中载酒行。\n渚花藏笑语，沙鸟乱歌声。\n晚棹沿流急，春衣逐吹轻。\n江南采菱曲，回首重含情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20488,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"直省中怀浚川","author":"薛蕙","text":"寓直深春日，端居薄暮时。\n钩帘看红药，隐几听黄鹂。\n省署容吾病，风尘怀我师。\n忧来对明镜，不贷发成丝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20489,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送樊侍御孝甫奉母东归","author":"薛蕙","text":"柱下随亲去，廷中得赐归。\n日斜乌鸟急，春煖凤雏飞。\n烟草迷骢马，风花逐绣衣。\n都门望行色，垂泪恋庭闱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20490,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄孙山人 其一","author":"薛蕙","text":"吾怜孙处士，万里狎沧波。\n海色占龙卧，天风闻凤歌。\n谁言窜身远，尚畏取名多。\n相望冥冥外，虞人奈尔何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20491,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄孙山人 其二","author":"薛蕙","text":"有客今何事，江边采日华。\n行穿四明雪，坐对赤城霞。\n中散宁为吏，梁鸿不顾家。\n思君入吴会，筑室炼丹砂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20492,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"道院看牡丹晚际遇雨作","author":"薛蕙","text":"把酒未成醉，恍然惊暮寒。\n薄阴含锦树，片雨湿朱阑。\n霞妥青丝佩，风摇赤玉盘。\n微芳恐销落，珍重卷帘看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20493,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"对雪","author":"薛蕙","text":"天外匿寒日，云边韬曙霞。\n风吹玉山雪，飞满谢公家。\n隔帘讶行月，拂槛认飘花。\n方持一樽酒，酣饮答年华。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20494,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏新竹","author":"薛蕙","text":"娟娟阶下竹，新绿渐氛氲。\n石影生寒气，沙光滴露纹。\n芝兰聊可品，桃李自难群。\n不待风霜日，苍然见此君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20495,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵酬孔汝锡","author":"薛蕙","text":"多君金马客，就我竹林间。\n对酒频移席，论文一解颜。\n词臣翻补外，野老合投闲。\n颍亳殊相近，诗筒约往还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20496,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"余有洮溪砚乃孔汝锡所赠者每怀其人因成斯咏","author":"薛蕙","text":"閒居无一事，雅好独斯文。\n每拂洮溪砚，因怀阙里君。\n题诗情款曲，挥翰思缤纷。\n凭寄关西使，何时到陇云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20497,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日宴集","author":"薛蕙","text":"连骑游南浦，方舟泛绿波。\n日华云际薄，春色水边多。\n兰渚容樽俎，花林映绮罗。\n韨除期亦逼，奈此宿酲何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20498,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"阅世","author":"薛蕙","text":"脱死风波路，偷生鸟兽群。\n赋材元散木，阅世只浮云。\n圣代惭无补，衰年幸有闻。\n佯狂堪卒岁，不必草玄文。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20499,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谢文徵仲写金刚经","author":"薛蕙","text":"斋沐开经卷，名香手自焚。\n天人遥作礼，鸾凤郁成文。\n心印传先佛，书林擅右军。\n殷勤谢良友，何日访停云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20500,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晨起","author":"薛蕙","text":"童子扫园径，山禽花外飞。\n青梧裛宿露，红槿丽晨晖。\n多病志意减，闲居宾客稀。\n今朝惜清景，偶此一沾衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20501,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"玉簪","author":"薛蕙","text":"澹泊宜开晚，纷敷喜在阴。\n秋风一披拂，花萼正萧森。\n比玉幽人操，怀霜烈女心。\n淹留玩芳草，聊用谢华簪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20502,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}}]